

Programm naddaf.


>> Veggy := Oġġett ġdid.
Veggy meta: ['ġdid'] agħmel: {
	>> v := innifsu ġdid.
	v init. <- v.
}.

Veggy meta: ['init'] agħmel: { proprju veggies := 0. }.

Veggy meta: ['carrots:'] agħmel: { :a proprju veggies := a. <- Xejn. }.
Veggy meta: ['carrots'] agħmel: { <- proprju veggies. }.
Veggy meta: ['+'] agħmel: { :f
	>> n := Veggy ġdid.
	n carrots: (f carrots + proprju veggies). <- n.
}.

Veggy meta: ['test'] agħmel: { <- proprju veggies test.
}.

Numru meta: ['carrots'] agħmel: {
	>> x := Veggy ġdid.
	x carrots: innifsu. <- x.
}.

Numru meta: ['add:and:'] agħmel: { :a :b <- (a + b).
}.

>> q := 0 add: (3 carrots + 2 carrots) and: 4 carrots.
Ħruġ ikteb: q, linja-ġdida.
